WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.980
Who tests your app before you ship it?

2
00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:05.460
You can ask an AI assistant to do it.

3
00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:07.939
It taps every button, like a customer.

4
00:00:07.939 --> 00:00:09.375
And it needs no phone.

5
00:00:10.975 --> 00:00:11.591
Step one.

6
00:00:11.591 --> 00:00:13.848
Start your shop in the simulator.

7
00:00:13.848 --> 00:00:16.378
Then give your assistant one setting.

8
00:00:16.378 --> 00:00:20.072
It tells Claude, or Cursor, to start the Shipvo tools.

9
00:00:20.072 --> 00:00:21.850
That plug is called MCP.

10
00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:24.015
Step two.

11
00:00:24.015 --> 00:00:25.962
Ask it to shop like a customer.

12
00:00:25.962 --> 00:00:26.779
Buy the tote.

13
00:00:26.779 --> 00:00:29.354
Make the payment fail, then make it work.

14
00:00:29.354 --> 00:00:33.750
The assistant taps through the app and tells you what the screen said.

15
00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:36.167
Step three.

16
00:00:36.167 --> 00:00:37.079
Ask for proof.

17
00:00:37.079 --> 00:00:41.119
The device log lists everything the app asked the phone to do.

18
00:00:41.119 --> 00:00:44.769
In our run, the log showed the payment going to "My Shop".

19
00:00:44.769 --> 00:00:46.854
But this shop is called Sandbar.

20
00:00:46.854 --> 00:00:49.200
The assistant caught a real mistake.

21
00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:51.484
Step four.

22
00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:53.192
Turn its run into a test.

23
00:00:53.192 --> 00:00:55.858
Ask for export test, and save the file.

24
00:00:55.858 --> 00:00:59.617
Then write the words that should appear on each screen.

25
00:00:59.617 --> 00:01:02.625
Now the check repeats by itself, in seconds.

26
00:01:04.225 --> 00:01:04.916
Step five.

27
00:01:04.916 --> 00:01:06.022
Make it a habit.

28
00:01:06.022 --> 00:01:09.064
Run your tests, and then a practice release.

29
00:01:09.064 --> 00:01:11.276
If a test fails, the line stops.

30
00:01:11.276 --> 00:01:13.350
Nothing is sent to your users.

31
00:01:15.225 --> 00:01:18.986
That is a safety check you can run before every release.

32
00:01:18.986 --> 00:01:24.225
The full guide is at shipvo.dev/docs/test-with-an-assistant.
